! i3's X11 session (bin/i3-autostart loads it): the HONOR's 3120x2080 panel at 2x, as sway's scale 2.0.
! Xft.dpi scales text and the toolkits that follow it (GTK, Qt, Chrome, kitty) natively, no blur
Xft.dpi: 192
Xft.antialias: 1
Xft.hinting: 1
Xft.hintstyle: hintslight
Xft.rgba: rgb
Xft.lcdfilter: lcddefault
Xcursor.size: 48
